  "title": "Cabbage Roll Casserole",
  "description": "This cabbage roll casserole combines chopped cabbage with ground beef, tomato sauce, and rice. It&#39;s easer to make than standard stuffed cabbage rolls!",
  "authors": [
    "BUCHKO"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-11-10T12:19:26-05:00",
